{"id":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","name":"Lofts of Thraben Cathedral","type":"location","aliases":["the Lofts"],"description":"A long abandoned cathedral Dovid cleaned so angels could use it as a place of rest.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2014-08-13","last_seen":"2014-08-13","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Dovid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Dovid\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e0","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: wounded at the battle of Child's Wall, Dovid lies feverish in the cathedral courtyard after Avacyn appears.","participants":["comitant-dovid","avacyn"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"minor","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":3,"quote":"and then a blinding light when, at last, Avacyn appeared.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=and%20then%20a%20blinding,at%20last%2C%20Avacyn%20appeared.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=and%20then%20a%20blinding,at%20last%2C%20Avacyn%20appeared.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e1","era":null,"summary":"Avacyn, with the angel Gryta, summons Dovid and orders him to prepare the forbidden space of the Lofts of Thraben Cathedral.","participants":["avacyn","gryta","comitant-dovid","lofts-of-thraben-cathedral"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"major","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":8,"quote":"You, and you alone, must prepare that space previously forbidden.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=You%2C%20and%20you%20alone%2C,that%20space%20previously%20forbidden.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=You%2C%20and%20you%20alone%2C,that%20space%20previously%20forbidden.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e2","era":null,"summary":"Dovid becomes Comitant Dovid, isolated from the cathars and church officials, carrying the first sword forged from the Helvault.","participants":["comitant-dovid","helvault"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"major","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"That is how I became Comitant Dovid.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=That%20is%20how%20I%20became%20Comitant%20Dovid.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=That%20is%20how%20I%20became%20Comitant%20Dovid.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e3","era":null,"summary":"Gryta opens a bricked window into the Lofts for Dovid and tells him to clear the cistern.","participants":["gryta","comitant-dovid","lofts-of-thraben-cathedral"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"minor","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"The bricked window folded into itself silently","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=The%20bricked%20window%20folded%20into%20itself%20silently","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=The%20bricked%20window%20folded%20into%20itself%20silently","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e4","era":null,"summary":"Dovid is given Eost, a sword forged from the Helvault, with his name at the top of the honored list.","participants":["comitant-dovid","eost","avacyn","gryta","helvault"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"minor","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":26,"quote":"I have drawn it only once, during the ceremony where it was presented to me, when Avacyn touched its point.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=I%20have%20drawn%20it,Avacyn%20touched%20its%20point.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=I%20have%20drawn%20it,Avacyn%20touched%20its%20point.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e5","era":null,"summary":"In the cistern Dovid finds a preserved, strangled man in black with a book in his coat, which he seals in a nameless crypt and takes the book.","participants":["comitant-dovid","lofts-of-thraben-cathedral"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"major","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"He had been strangled, and although there were no signs of rot, he was murdered some time before","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=He%20had%20been%20strangled%2C,murdered%20some%20time%20before","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=He%20had%20been%20strangled%2C,murdered%20some%20time%20before","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13-e6","era":null,"summary":"Dovid solves the Nightfall Cathars' spell on the journal and learns that Avacyn had been sealed with Griselbrand and that church power diminished, a secret kept from the congregation.","participants":["comitant-dovid","nightfall-cathars","avacyn","griselbrand","mikaeus"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"major","page":"stories/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","order":460,"story_date":"2014-08-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"Avacyn had been sealed in the Helvault with the demon Griselbrand, and during that time our power had diminished.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=Avacyn%20had%20been%20sealed,our%20power%20had%20diminished.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lunarch's Journal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Colin Kawakami"],"date":"2014-08-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lunarchs-journal-2014-08-13#:~:text=Avacyn%20had%20been%20sealed,our%20power%20had%20diminished.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lunarch's Journal\" by Colin Kawakami. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Aug 2014."}},{"id":"dovid-e1","era":null,"summary":"Avacyn and Gryta task Dovid with cleaning out the abandoned Lofts of Thraben Cathedral.","participants":["avacyn","gryta","comitant-dovid"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/dovid","order":1535,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":1,"quote":"tasked Dovid with cleaning out the long abandoned Lofts of Thraben cathedral","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid#:~:text=tasked%20Dovid%20with%20cleaning,Lofts%20of%20Thraben%20cathedral","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Dovid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid#:~:text=tasked%20Dovid%20with%20cleaning,Lofts%20of%20Thraben%20cathedral","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Dovid\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"dovid-e2","era":null,"summary":"In the Lofts Dovid finds a preserved strangled man in a cistern with the journal of Lunarch Mikaeus Cecani.","participants":["comitant-dovid","mikaeus"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/dovid","order":1535,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"It was the journal of the deceased Lunarch Mikaeus Cecani","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid#:~:text=It%20was%20the%20journal,deceased%20Lunarch%20Mikaeus%20Cecani","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Dovid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid#:~:text=It%20was%20the%20journal,deceased%20Lunarch%20Mikaeus%20Cecani","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Dovid\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"dovid-e3","era":null,"summary":"Dovid learns from the journal that Edgar Markov created vampires through a pact with Shilgengar and the blood of Marycz.","participants":["comitant-dovid","edgar-markov","shilgengar","marycz"],"location":"lofts-of-thraben-cathedral","importance":"major","page":"wiki/dovid","order":1535,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":3,"quote":"Dovid was shocked at learning that the terrible vampires feeding on his people were created by none other than the very humans themselves.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dovid#:~:text=Dovid%20was%20shocked%20at,the%20very%20humans%20themselves.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Dovid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"htt